    },
    {
      "id": "claim_03d60f4fd6f94a3ea7deb417c0f5f1fc",
      "statement": "The two setup files share one definition of the accounts steps: `ulabase.setup.ts` exports them via `defineSetup`, and `ulabase.setup.consents.ts` spreads them with `...accounts.steps`. The consents file centralizes `TOS_VERSION` and `PP_VERSION` so bumping them and re-running the setup is the only action needed to publish new terms.",
